{"parentUuid":"5a6baa36-aa2c-480d-9385-e39d7a13f430","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"49832040-465b-48c3-8853-fc9aaaff2d1f","agentId":"a4438d81d0b74ba38","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ny5KQLSqdqmAFi9VdLHcmy","type":"tool_result","content":"# CPAIOR 2024 Accepted Papers - Relevant to Your Focus Areas\n\nBased on the conference proceedings, here are papers matching your specified topics:\n\n**Scheduling:**\n- \"Learning to Solve Job Shop Scheduling under Uncertainty\" – Guillaume Infantes\n- \"Learning From Scenarios for Repairable Stochastic Scheduling\" – Kim van den Houten\n- \"Acquiring Constraints for a Non-linear Transmission Maintenance Scheduling Problem\" – Hugo Barral\n- \"A Constraint Programming Approach for Aircraft Disassembly Scheduling\" – Charles Thomas\n- \"ULD Build-Up Scheduling with Logic-Based Benders Decomposition\" – Ricardo Euler\n\n**Decomposition:**\n- \"Decision-focused predictions via pessimistic bilevel optimization\" – Víctor Bucarey\n- \"A Benders decomposition approach for a capacitated multi-vehicle covering tour problem\" – Vera Fischer\n- \"Bound Tightening using Rolling-Horizon Decomposition for Neural Network Verification\" – Haoruo Zhao\n\n**Machine Learning/Heuristics:**\n- \"Learning Heuristics for Combinatorial Optimization Problems on K-Partite Hypergraphs\" – Mehdi Zouitine\n- \"An Improved Neuro-Symbolic Architecture to Fine-Tune Generative AI Systems\" – Chao Yin\n- \"Towards a Generic Representation of Combinatorial Problems for Learning-Based Approaches\" – Léo Boisvert\n\n**Large Neighborhood Search:**\n- \"ViolationLS: Constraint-Based Local Search in CP-SAT\" – Toby Davies"}]},"uuid":"5de1b600-7a13-49c3-bedd-b1b833133f9d","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:43:21.076Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5a6baa36-aa2c-480d-9385-e39d7a13f430","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"mas